From udd632bd3bbcdd7e9 at groups.google.com  Wed Jul 28 18:18:08 2021
From: udd632bd3bbcdd7e9 at groups.google.com (Perry de Valpine)
Date: Wed, 28 Jul 2021 18:18:08 +0000
Subject: Re: Multinomial nodes in RJ-MCMC
Message-ID: <VI-jaKbc-zc.ws6jB0M9AAAJ@nimble-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <VI-jaKbc-zc.-B47n813BAAJ@nimble-users.groups.google.com>
References: <VI-jaKbc-zc.-B47n813BAAJ@nimble-users.groups.google.com>
